OL,3,GNEWSAMajority of homes in NI have power
OL,4,Arestored after Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe majority of properties affected by
OL,7,Fpower cuts during Storm Boelo have now
OL,8,Fhad their electricity restored.
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland Electricity Networks
OL,11,F(NIE) said around 12,500 properties
OL,12,Fwere without power at one stage.
OL,14,FIn the Republic of Ireland, about 5,000
OL,15,Fhomes, farms and businesses were still
OL,16,Fwithout electricity on Sunday evening.
OL,18,FThe storm saw gusts of wind reach
OL,19,Falmost 80mph in some areas on Saturday
OL,20,Fand led to flights being cancelled at
OL,21,FBelfast City, Belfast International and
OL,22,FDublin Airport.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
